	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg1120"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=52" title="View the profile of Gabus">Gabus</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 292<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/psychotic-day.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I beat the Internet. The end guy was hard.<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=52"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=254.msg1120#msg1120"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=254.msg1120#msg1120">Re:Loyalist Shield of Honor</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #2 on:</b> June 12, 2003, 09:55:06 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							None of the ashes in the bazzar are the correct one. I got swindled for 10K buying them one night. I didnt know that there were 2 types of ashes that were IDENTICAL in every way except by identify. When I finally got ahold of the seller after the quest didnt work, he said that he new that there were two types of ashes, but claimed he didnt know which ones the ones i bought were. (complete bullshit btw, he was selling a worthless item for 10K looking for a sucker, and found one in me, and knew damn well that there was no way anyone could tell the difference) I petitioned the GM about misrepresentation of an item and predatory pricing, but since the seller never ACTUALLY said that they were the right ones, I had no case. Then I e-mailed the GM of the server about the quest being bugged, allowing for identical droppable items for a quest leading to future problems, and the response i got was.. /bug it and I can be part of a future solution so no one gets screwed like i did. <br /><br />Since the ashes are lore, I have kept the worthless ones, and check those in the bazzar every so often to see if they are the correct ones. Since they are lore, If they are the same worthless ones I have, it wont let me buy em. Anyone selling those things in the bazzar should be shot. The poor buyer has no idea what hes getting untill its in his hand, and there isnt a damn thing the GMs will do about it if the seller is a smart crook.<br /><br />Moral of the story, you gotta get the ashes yourself. <br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />- I beat the Internet. The end guy was hard!<br /><a href="http://www.magelo.com/eq_view_profile.html?num=139779" target="_blank">Gabus Copperdrachon Magelo Profile</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg1123"></a>
