								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=254.msg7130#msg7130"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=254.msg7130#msg7130">Re:Loyalist Shield of Honor</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #4 on:</b> April 19, 2004, 08:07:23 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Hah.. I cant believe I posted this nearly a year ago, and I finally got the ashes last week! Ah well.. another quest done, another one to find.<br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
