								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Sorry for the bump:<br /><br />I&#039;m beginging to start this quest with my paladin, he needs a new back slot, and was wondering if he could this quest alone at 58? Or how much help would he need? He&#039;s decently geared and has about 5k hp w/ Virt.<br /><br />I have a 70SK friend helping me collect the ashes as I type (I love laptops), We killed the first mob that spawns, got the fake ashes from him and a Fist of Iron. Going after the real one now which We know is a necro.<br /><br />Suppose I tried this quest at 58, how much help would I need do you think?<br /><br />Thnx<br />Nait
