								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Not much help, but I am not sure how much your SK friend will really be able to help. (unsure about SK capabilities at 70) The problem is, that zeefer is completely immune to melee damage, so you need nukage to wipe him, and a tank to tank him. He doesnt hit terribly hard, but if you were gonna tank him at 58, you are gonna want a dedicated healer. Best thing would be for your SK friend to tank, while a wiz, druid, necro, or cleric (with the anti undead spells) nuke the crap out of it. A team of 2 people 65+ would make short work of him. Zeefer cons at 60 IIRC. The biggest pain of zeefer is waiting for him to pop. 
						</td>
					</tr>
