							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Was just curious if melee&#039;ing with the pally vampire bane quest sword from Katta would work?<br /><br /><img src="http://everquest.allakhazam.com/equipment/graphics17/Ashbringer.jpg" alt="" border="0" /><br /><br />Ashbringer <br />MAGIC ITEM&nbsp; LORE ITEM <br />Slot: PRIMARY <br />Skill: 2H Slashing Atk Delay: 38 <br />DMG: 18 <br />Fire DMG: 5 <br />Bane DMG: Vampyre +10 <br />Effect: Flame Shock (Combat) <br />WT: 10.0 Size: LARGE <br />Class: PAL <br />Race: HUM ERU HIE HEF DWF HFL GNM FRG&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <br /><br />Would be nice if it had more uses than just the guy in seru. I tried to look up his name, because I forget right now. i&#039;m on painkillers(had teeth pulled, spitting lots of blood) and I forget and dont care that much about the damn seru guy, cause he doesn&#039;t really matter for this topic anyway
