								Drolvarg Guardian<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Male.gif" alt="Male" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 292<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/psychotic-day.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I beat the Internet. The end guy was hard.<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=52"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=254.msg16475#msg16475"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=254.msg16475#msg16475">Re: Loyalist Shield of Honor</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #9 on:</b> April 15, 2005, 10:04:47 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Yes, I can confirm that bane weapons DO work on zeefer, and any procs off of weapons work as well. (IE you swing and the hit does nothing, but the proc hurts him) IIRC though, just the bane damage hurts him, not the dmg of the weapon, so if the weapon hits for 18, and normally does +10 on vamps, only the +10 is actually going to go through on zeefer, so your dmg output is terribly low. (note this is not the case for bane weapons normally) <br /><br />Also, Slay Undead does not work on him with regular weapons either, but it might work on bane weapons. (I did not have SU when I fought him so I am not sure) He does count as undead though for the purposes of spells, and you want to drop him quick because he does have a lifetap, and thats just annoying. Druids can kite him, but it takes a LONG time for any druid under 65 to do it, and warpage is a problem. (or was when I was doing it)
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
